  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**UPPER** converts text to all capital letters: `=UPPER(text)`. `LOWER` makes every letter lowercase: `=LOWER(text)`. `PROPER` capitalises the first letter of each word: `=PROPER(text)`. `PROPER` capitalises the first letter of each word and any letter after a non-letter (like ' or -), and makes the rest lowercase."
    },
